    "innovation": "By synthesizing a global dataset of over 6000 soil samples, this study demonstrates that the relationship between climate and soil nitrogen isotopes is indirect, mediated by climate-driven variations in soil carbon and clay content, challenging previous interpretations of global nitrogen cycling.",
